    "text": "{\n  \"anomaly_detected\": true,\n  \"confidence\": 0.99,\n  \"anomalies\": [\n    {\n      \"category\": \"open_connection\",\n      \"components\": [\"D3\", \"J8\", \"U1\", \"D6\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"D3.3\", \"J8.3\", \"U1.31\", \"D6.1\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"NC-D3-0\", \"FAN_1_TACH\", \"Net-(D3-A)\"],\n      \"observed\": \"The FAN_1_TACH net connects J8.3 and D6.1, but not the MCU input. U1.31 (GPIO21) connects to D3.1 through its pull-up, while D3.3 is on the unconnected net NC-D3-0. Thus the fan-1 tach signal has no path to the MCU.\",\n      \"expected\": \"The fan-1 tach signal should reach an ESP32 input, as required for monitoring both fan tachometers; D3.3 should connect to FAN_1_TACH, analogous to D4 connecting the other fan tach input to the MCU.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"12\\\") (name \\\"FAN_1_TACH\\\") ... (node (ref \\\"D6\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") ...) (node (ref \\\"J8\\\") (pin \\\"3\\\") ...))\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"15\\\") (name \\\"Net-(D3-A)\\\") ... (node (ref \\\"D3\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") ...) (node (ref \\\"U1\\\") (pin \\\"31\\\") (pinfunction \\\"GPIO21/U0TXD\\\") ...))\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"39\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(U1-GPIO3{slash}ADC1_CH3-Pad6)\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"spec\",\n          \"quote\": \"Monitors 2 fan tachometers (NUM_FANS = 2) with TVS-diode-protected inputs, and raises a run fault if a fan stalls.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The MCU cannot observe fan 1 tach pulses, so that fan's stall condition cannot be detected reliably; its GPIO input will remain pulled high rather than reflecting the tach signal.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"An open connection disconnects fan 1's tach signal from the ESP32. The netlist places D3's cathode on an unconnected net while the connector's FAN_1_TACH net does not reach the MCU, contrary to the specified monitoring of two fans.\"\n}",
